<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-SVORADA WINS FOURTH STAGE OF TOUR OF CATALONIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-SVORADA WINS FOURTH STAGE OF TOUR OF CATALONIA.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan Svorada of Slovakia won the fourth stage of the Tour of Catalonia over 130 kms between San Juan Despi and Barcelona on Sunday.</p>
